message: "If you use this dataset, the KIRIN diagnostic tool, or the Championship Cube framework, please cite as below."
title: "The Championship Cube: A Front Office Framework for Building NBA Champions"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mohammad
    family-names: "[ADD SURNAME]"
    affiliation: "Royal Holloway, University of London"
repository-code: "[ADD GITHUB URL]"
abstract: >
  A six-dimensional framework (Team Face, Player Face, Coach Face, Front
  Office Face, Controllable External Face, Uncontrollable External Face)
  for evaluating NBA championship contention, built from a 74 team-season
  dataset (37 champions, 37 Finals runners-up, 1990-2026). Includes the
  KIRIN prototype, a live self-assessed diagnostic tool implementing the
  same framework as a forward-looking instrument.
keywords:
  - sports analytics
  - basketball
  - NBA
  - front office
  - decision support
